    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i used to think i was special. like, i actually believed i had that spark for competitive programming. but after this last set of results... it finally hit me. i'm just a mid-tier dev. i'll never be one of the ones people actually remember. i'm just gonna spend the next 40 years being \"fine\" and \"competent\" while the real geniuses move the world. it feels like a joke.",
